== devsweep optimize list (en, human) ==
Optimize catalogue: 8 operations; catalogue version 1.
dns.flush | Execute | Native System32 ipconfig.exe /flushdns, bounded to 10 seconds
settings.storage_recommendations | Settings handoff | Windows build 22000 or later; opens the fixed Settings page
settings.search | Settings handoff | Windows build 22000 or later; opens the fixed Settings page
settings.energy_recommendations | Settings handoff | Windows build 22624 or later; opens the fixed Settings page
guidance.drive_optimize | Guidance only | Guidance only; DevSweep never dispatches it
guidance.system_integrity | Guidance only | Guidance only; DevSweep never dispatches it
guidance.filesystem_check | Guidance only | Guidance only; DevSweep never dispatches it
guidance.network_reset | Guidance only | Guidance only; DevSweep never dispatches it
exit=0

